<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras finds potential oil site.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras finds potential oil site.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Surveys at a potential site off the coast of Brazil's Rio Grande do Norte state has revealed a promising oil discovery only three meters below the sea's surface, state oil monopoly Petrobras said in a statement.</p>
<p>Two areas showed potential production of 420 to 700 barrels a day. Preliminary statistics suggest a reserve of around eight million barrels of oil, it added.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
